;; Card 45995775 (Q31): an unseen cell's light is guessed from the light the body perceives, not from the open sky or the clock.
;; jobs.debug.ready-probe (safe-at, :stay-s 120) at an unseen cell; it emits job.ready-probe only once started.
;; dark-room-by-day (should-fail): a sealed unlit stone room on a sky plot at noon; the :at cell [20 0 16] lies in its dark,
;; unseen. No seen light reaches it, so it is guessed dark: the probe waits :exposed. The old guess read it as open sky, lit by day.
;; lit-hall-at-night (should-succeed): a sealed glowstone-lit hall at night; the :at cell [23 0 15] lies round a corner of a
;; passage, unseen, one step from the seen passage end (light 13, glowstone in the end wall), so it is guessed lit and
;; the probe starts. The old guess read every unseen cell dark at night by the clock, lit by day: it waited :exposed for dawn.
{:defaults
 {:tags [:readiness :light]
  :plot {:light :sky :floor "grass_block" :height 8}
  :blocks [[:fill [2 0 8] [26 4 24] "stone"]]
  :limit-s 70}
 :cases
 [{:name "dark-room-by-day-unseen-cell-waits-exposed"
   :blocks [[:fill [6 0 12] [22 1 20] "air"]]
   :body {:at [8.5 0 16.5] :yaw -90 :settle-s 2 :effects [["resistance" 900 4]]}
   :act [[:job (jobs.debug.ready-probe {:at #at [20 0 16] :stay-s 120})]]
   :expect [{:event {:source :job :kind :waiting :data {:reason :exposed}} :within-s 40 :of-job true}
            {:no-event {:source :job :kind :job.ready-probe} :for-s 25 :of-job true}]}
  {:name "lit-hall-at-night-unseen-cell-round-a-corner-starts"
   :time :night :time-why :night-light
   :blocks [[:fill [4 0 12] [20 2 20] "air"] [:fill [21 0 16] [23 1 16] "air"] [:fill [23 0 12] [23 1 15] "air"]
            [:set [8 3 16] "glowstone"] [:set [14 3 16] "glowstone"] [:set [19 3 13] "glowstone"] [:set [19 3 19] "glowstone"]
            [:set [24 1 16] "glowstone"] [:set [24 1 13] "glowstone"]]
   :body {:at [6.5 0 16.5] :yaw -90 :settle-s 2 :effects [["resistance" 900 4]]}
   :act [[:job (jobs.debug.ready-probe {:at #at [23 0 15] :stay-s 120})]]
   :expect [{:event {:source :job :kind :job.ready-probe} :within-s 40 :of-job true}
            {:no-event {:source :job :kind :waiting :data {:reason :exposed}} :for-s 1 :of-job true}]}]}
